---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Om Mathias - Mathias Jakobsen">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <section class="pt-24 md:pt-32 pb-16 md:pb-24">
      <div class="max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 ml-4 sm:ml-12 lg:ml-24">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-light text-frost-dark leading-tight mb-6">
          About Me
        </h1>
        
        <div class="space-y-8 text-lg text-frost-accent leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            I'm Mathias Jakobsen, a CTO and software engineer with over 15 years of experience building scalable systems and leading engineering teams.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            My journey in tech started with a passion for solving complex problems through code. Over the years, I've worked with startups building their first products, growing companies scaling to millions of users, and enterprises modernizing their legacy systems.
          </p>
          
          <p>
            What drives me is the intersection of technology and business impact. I believe the best technical solutions are those that directly contribute to business goals - whether that's faster time-to-market, improved user experience, or reduced operational costs.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light text-frost-dark mb-4">Experience Highlights</h2>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              <li>• Led engineering teams from 5 to 50+ engineers</li>
              <li>• Architected systems handling millions of requests per day</li>
              <li>• Helped multiple startups secure Series A funding through technical excellence</li>
              <li>• Mentored dozens of engineers in their career growth</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12">
            <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light text-frost-dark mb-4">Technical Philosophy</h2>
            <p>
              I believe in pragmatic engineering - choosing the right tool for the job, balancing technical debt with feature velocity, and always keeping the end user in mind. Clean code, comprehensive testing, and clear documentation aren't luxuries - they're essentials for sustainable growth.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-12">
            <a
              href="/kontakt"
              class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-frost-dark text-white rounded-frost hover:bg-frost-accent transition-all duration-250 hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-lg"
            >
              Get in Touch
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
